  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Goin Gets Tough From the Get Go**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Squelch the Little Weasel**: back after 129 archived shows (765 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **ICMPFOI**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2001-08-31** (recommended): audience recording; 34 songs; 157 min [1]. Said about its sound: The DVD rips sounded noisy and tinny, though Audacity adjustments improved their volume and clarity [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Finger [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2001-08-31**: taped by Unknown, The Stallion; source: Unknown AUD [1]. Also: First six tracks came from a DVD shot by the Stallion, edited by Kingofpoland; Tracks seven through thirty-five are an unknown taper's audio recording, missing the initial six songs [1]",
